.SS "\fBPart\fP bindToAnimationBinding (string name)"

.PP
Follow an authored binding\&. Replaces the previous authored frame and explicit parent while retaining local offsets\&. Does not copy or hide the authored artwork\&. Replacing the rig invalidates this association\&. Unknown names or dynamic-body reparenting throw\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIname\fP Exact authored binding name in the owner's current rig\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This object, for chaining\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Enable the owning \fBSprite\fP's animation pose before binding\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBgetAnimationBindingName()\fP, \fBunbindFromBone()\fP 
.RE
.PP

