See \fBprocedural_fabrik_options\fP\&.

.PP
One-shot solve returns diagnostics and applies angles immediately\&. Scheduled controller owners must be cleared before installing competing controllers\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIchain\fP Contiguous descendants, excluding this \fBPart\fP\&. 
.br
\fItarget\fP Desired endpoint in the configured coordinate frame\&. 
